"--i:1\">with</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:2\">AFSV</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:3\">VRC.</span></span></span></h1>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"xhero__under\">\n      <p class=\"lead\">We’re inviting brands, makers and community businesses to sell alongside the AFSV VRC collection. Tell us about your products and our team will review your application.</p>\n      <div class=\"btn-row\"><a class=\"btn btn--navy\" href=\"#vendor-apply\">Apply to sell<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"78f79c77","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"vendor.process","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"2ae5c3b4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"vendor.process\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">The process</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">How becoming a vendor works.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <ol class=\"psteps\" data-stagger>\n    <li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">01</span><h3>Apply</h3><p>Fill in the form below with your company details, how many products you’d like to sell and their value.</p></li><li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">02</span><h3>Evaluation</h3><p>Your application is emailed to our marketplace team for review. We look at product fit, quality, values and pricing — usually within ten business days.</p></li><li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">03</span><h3>Samples &amp; terms</h3><p>Shortlisted vendors share samples and we agree simple, clear terms together.</p></li><li class=\"psteps__item\"><span class=\"psteps__n\">04</span><h3>Go live</h3><p>We set up your listings, fulfilment and payments, ready for when the marketplace opens.</p></li>\n  </ol>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"6e834953","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"vendor.criteria","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"21a750e1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"vendor.criteria\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">What we look for</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Products our community will love.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n    \n  <div class=\"kgrid kgrid--4\" data-stagger>\n    <article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 3.4l2.6 5.4 5.8.8-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.8l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8-4.2-4.1 5.8-.8z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Quality</h3>\n      <p>Well-made products that last and that you’re proud of.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"6.4\" r=\"2.4\"/><circle cx=\"5.4\" cy=\"9.4\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18.6\" cy=\"9.4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7.6 20.4v-2.6a4.4 4.4 0 0 1 8.8 0v2.6\"/><path d=\"M2.2 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 4.8-2.8M21.8 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 0-4.8-2.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Shared values</h3>\n      <p>Brands that support youth, sport, education and inclusion.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.8 6.4h11v9.6h-11zM13.8 9.6h3.8l3 3.4v3h-6.8z\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"17.4\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"16.8\" cy=\"17.4\" r=\"1.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Reliable fulfilment</h3>\n      <p>Stock you can deliver on time, every time.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.6\"/><path d=\"M3.4 12h17.2\"/><path d=\"M12 3.4c2.4 2.4 3.6 5.2 3.6 8.6s-1.2 6.2-3.6 8.6c-2.4-2.4-3.6-5.2-3.6-8.6s1.2-6.2 3.6-8.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Local &amp; diaspora makers</h3>\n      <p>Canadian, Caribbean and diaspora-owned businesses are very welcome.</p>\n      \n    </article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"13b79765","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"vendor.form","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"8e31e5fa","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section \" id=\"vendor-apply\" data-el=\"vendor.form\" data-el-build=\"plugin\">\n  <div class=\"split split--form\">\n    <div class=\"form-intro reveal\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Apply to become a vendor.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-lg\">The more you tell us, the faster we can evaluate your application.</p>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Submitting an application is not an approval and does not create a vendor account.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n<form class=\"form\" data-preview-form>\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--danger)\">*</span><span class=\"sr-only\">with an asterisk</span> are required.</p>\n  <div class=\"form__grid\">\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f180\">Company name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f180\" name=\"company-name\" autocomplete=\"organization\" aria-describedby=\"f180-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f180-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f181\">Brand name (if different) <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f181\" name=\"brand-name-if-different\" aria-describedby=\"f181-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f181-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f182\">Contact name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f182\" name=\"contact-name\" autocomplete=\"name\" aria-describedby=\"f182-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f182-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f183\">Role or title <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f183\" name=\"role-or-title\" autocomplete=\"organization-title\" aria-describedby=\"f183-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f183-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f184\">Email<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"email\" id=\"f184\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"f184-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f184-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f185\">Phone <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"tel\" id=\"f185\" name=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\" aria-describedby=\"f185-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f185-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f186\">Website or social link<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"url\" id=\"f186\" name=\"website-or-social-link\" aria-describedby=\"f186-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"https://\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f186-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f187\">Country<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f187\" name=\"country\" autocomplete=\"country-name\" aria-describedby=\"f187-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f187-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f188\">Business type<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f188\" name=\"business-type\" aria-describedby=\"f188-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"Brand or manufacturer\">Brand or manufacturer</option><option value=\"Artisan or maker\">Artisan or maker</option><option value=\"Distributor or wholesaler\">Distributor or wholesaler</option><option value=\"Retailer\">Retailer</option><option value=\"Athlete-owned business\">Athlete-owned business</option><option value=\"Non-profit or social enterprise\">Non-profit or social enterprise</option><option value=\"Other\">Other</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f188-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f189\">Product category<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f189\" name=\"product-category\" aria-describedby=\"f189-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"Apparel &amp; fanwear\">Apparel &amp; fanwear</option><option value=\"Training &amp; performance gear\">Training &amp; performance gear</option><option value=\"Accessories\">Accessories</option><option value=\"Books &amp; education resources\">Books &amp; education resources</option><option value=\"Health &amp; wellness\">Health &amp; wellness</option><option value=\"Food &amp; beverage\">Food &amp; beverage</option><option value=\"Art, crafts &amp; gifts\">Art, crafts &amp; gifts</option><option value=\"Other\">Other</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f189-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f190\">Number of products<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f190\" name=\"number-of-products\" aria-describedby=\"f190-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">How many products?</option><option value=\"1–5\">1–5</option><option value=\"6–20\">6–20</option><option value=\"21–50\">21–50</option><option value=\"51–100\">51–100</option><option value=\"Over 100\">Over 100</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f190-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f191\">Estimated total value of products<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f191\" name=\"estimated-total-value-of-products\" aria-describedby=\"f191-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Choose a range</option><option value=\"Under $5,000\">Under $5,000</option><option value=\"$5,000–$25,000\">$5,000–$25,000</option><option value=\"$25,000–$100,000\">$25,000–$100,000</option><option value=\"$100,000–$500,000\">$100,000–$500,000</option><option value=\"Over $500,000\">Over $500,000</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f191-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f192\">Typical retail price per item <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f192\" name=\"typical-retail-price-per-item\" aria-describedby=\"f192-err\"><option value=\"\">Choose a range</option><option value=\"Under $25\">Under $25</option><option value=\"$25–$75\">$25–$75</option><option value=\"$75–$150\">$75–$150</option><option value=\"Over $150\">Over $150</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f192-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f193\">Where are your products made? <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f193\" name=\"where-are-your-products-made\" aria-describedby=\"f193-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f193-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field field--full\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f194\">Describe your products<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <textarea id=\"f194\" name=\"describe-your-products\" aria-describedby=\"f194-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"\"></textarea>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f194-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field field--full\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f195\">Certifications or sustainability practices <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <textarea id=\"f195\" name=\"certifications-or-sustainability-practices\" aria-describedby=\"f195-err\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"\"></textarea>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f195-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div></div>\n  <label class=\"check\" for=\"f179\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f179\" name=\"consent\" required aria-describedby=\"f179-err\"><span>I confirm these details are accurate and agree to be contacted about my application.<span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f179-err\"></span></span></label>\n  <div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden><strong>Thank you.</strong>Development preview — this form is not connected yet. When connected, your application is emailed to info@afsvhcl.com for evaluation.</div>\n  <div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--navy\">Submit for evaluation<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></button></div>\n</form>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]}]}